---
// Icon language for runner pages (/checklist, routes, logbook).
// One inline sprite, referenced with <svg class="ic"><use href="#i-shoe"/></svg>.
// All symbols are 24x24, stroke-only, drawn on a 1.75px stroke so they sit
// evenly next to each other at any size. Add new symbols here, not in pages.
---
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true">
